Listen closely

277
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:18,320
Your mother was killed in that fire

278
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:22,920
Your brother met the same fate

279
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:30,920
Why?

280
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:32,820
Why did you lie to me?

281
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,920
To keep you from getting involved in this mess

282
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:38,120
If they found out about your powers

283
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,260
If they found out about your powers, they'd have come for you, too

284
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:43,800
I lied because I wanted the fear of the flames to be strong in you

285
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:48,520
I wanted you to hate fire so much that you'd never think of using your powers

286
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:51,920
And no one would ever find out you had them

287
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,620
Well, I do hate fire

288
00:16:53,620 --> 00:16:54,500
Even now

289
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:56,480
Even knowing that you lied

290
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,300
Whatever caused that fire 12 years ago

291
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:02,840
Flames are what took my family away from me

292
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:05,040
And for that, I'll always hate them

293
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,720
That said

294
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:09,880
It's by using them that you've made it as far as you have

295
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:17,260
I said what I came to say, so I'll take my leave now

296
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:18,340
Wait a sec, please

297
00:17:18,340 --> 00:17:21,460
I've got one more question

298
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:23,340
Have you had an Adola link?

299
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:25,000
Have you looked at hell for yourself?

300
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:25,940
Yeah

301
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:29,660
It cost me an eye, but I've seen the flames of hell

302
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:32,300
The demon from 12 years ago

303
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:35,080
Was it an infernal with horns where its eyes should have been?

304
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:36,720
It was

305
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,420
Then back at the nether

306
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:39,660
That was her

307
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:43,780
Where'd my mom go?

308
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:44,820
Did you see?

309
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:48,800
I only ever got that one glimpse

310
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:56,020
If I make another Adola link

311
00:17:56,020 --> 00:17:58,760
Then maybe I can see that infernal again

312
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:01,520
I could see mom again

313
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:04,840
