314
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,680
That captain

315
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,580
I saw him in Adola

316
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:11,720
I'm sorry, but

317
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:14,020
