320
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,760
Sounded like you said him

321
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:24,340
Well, uh

322
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,180
You're Lieutenant Agu, right?

323
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:26,920
Yes

324
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,660
Well, then I have to ask

325
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:30,540
Company 4, their captain

326
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:32,200
Oh, yeah

327
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:35,480
Captain Suichiro Agu of the 4th is my grandfather

328
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,440
As you've apparently guessed

329
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,480
